---
import { 
  Sparkles, 
  Terminal, 
  Clock, 
  FolderTree, 
  Share2, 
  CheckCircle2, 
  ArrowRight, 
  FileCode, 
  ChevronRight, 
  Activity,
  RotateCw,
  Cpu,
  Layers
} from "@lucide/svelte";
import BentoCustomizer from "./BentoCustomizer.svelte";
import BentoRecipes from "./BentoRecipes.svelte";

const { lang = 'es' } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="features" class="w-full max-w-5xl px-4 py-16 mx-auto">
  <!-- Section Badge & Header -->
  <div class="text-center mb-16 flex flex-col items-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 mb-4 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/10 border border-brand-primary/20 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-primary tracking-wide uppercase select-none">
      <Sparkles size={12} class="animate-pulse" />
      <span class="lang-es">Características Interactivas</span>
      <span class="lang-en">Interactive Features</span>
    </div>
    
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4 text-text-main max-w-2xl font-sans leading-tight">
      <span class="lang-es">Mantén tu código estructurado <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-primary to-brand-secondary bg-clip-text text-transparent">del Día 1 al Día 2.</span></span>
      <span class="lang-en">Keep your codebase structured <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-primary to-brand-secondary bg-clip-text text-transparent">from Day 1 to Day 2.</span></span>
    </h2>
    
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-text-muted max-w-xl">
      <span class="lang-es">Claw reemplaza las plantillas y la configuración manual con un potente motor de desarrollo en Go. ¡Haz clic en las tarjetas para probar el sistema interactivo en vivo!</span>
      <span class="lang-en">Claw replaces manual configuration and templates with a robust, instant Go-powered developer engine. Click on the cards below to test our configuration system live!</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Bento Grid Layout -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8 auto-rows-[minmax(380px,_auto)]">
    
    <!-- CARD 1: TECH SELECTION (Spans 2 columns on MD+) -->
    <div class="md:col-span-2 group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-surface/40 backdrop-blur-md p-6 sm:p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-brand-secondary/5 hover:border-brand-secondary/30">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-secondary/5 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none"></div>
      
      <!-- Card Visual Mockup -->
      <div class="relative w-full mb-8 group-hover:translate-y-[-4px] transition-transform duration-300">
        <BentoCustomizer client:load lang={lang} />
      </div>
      
      <!-- Card Copy -->
      <div class="mt-auto relative z-15 select-none">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-brand-secondary/10 text-brand-secondary">
            <Terminal size={18} />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-main lang-es">Personalizador de Stack</h3>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-main lang-en">Interactive Stack Customizer</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed lang-es">
          Configura modelos de backend, métodos de renderizado en frontend, bases de datos en contenedores y linters. Haz clic en las opciones para simular un setup manual a medida.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed lang-en">
          Configure backend models, frontend rendering methods, database containers, and lint environments. Click on options to simulate a tailored manual setup.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CARD 2: TECH DETAILS (Spans 1 column) -->
    <div class="group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-surface/40 backdrop-blur-md p-6 sm:p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-brand-primary/5 hover:border-brand-primary/30">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-primary/5 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none"></div>

      <!-- Card Visual Mockup -->
      <div class="relative w-full flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[220px] mb-6">
        <div class="w-full bg-bg-base/90 rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle p-5 font-sans space-y-4 group-hover:translate-y-[-4px] transition-transform duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border-subtle pb-2.5 select-none">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-main flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Cpu size={14} class="text-brand-primary" />
              <span class="lang-es">Arquitectura en Go</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Go-Native Architecture</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-brand-primary bg-brand-primary/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold lang-es">
              Autónomo
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-brand-primary bg-brand-primary/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold lang-en">
              Standalone
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-[11px] text-text-muted">
            <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-border-subtle/40 pb-1">
              <span class="lang-es">Tipo de Binario</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Binary Type</span>
              <span class="text-text-main font-bold lang-es">Nativo Único</span>
              <span class="text-text-main font-bold lang-en">Single Native</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-border-subtle/40 pb-1">
              <span class="lang-es">Arranque</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Cold Start</span>
              <span class="text-brand-primary font-bold">0.002s</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-border-subtle/40 pb-1">
              <span class="lang-es">Dependencias</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Dependencies</span>
              <span class="text-text-main font-bold lang-es">Ninguna (Offline)</span>
              <span class="text-text-main font-bold lang-en">None (Offline)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span>Distributor</span>
              <span class="text-text-main">GoReleaser</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card Copy -->
      <div class="mt-auto relative z-15 select-none">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary">
            <Clock size={18} />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-main lang-es">CLI en Go de Alto Rendimiento</h3>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-main lang-en">High Performance Go CLI</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed lang-es">
          Cero dependencias en el sistema local. Compila en un binario nativo único para velocidades de carga instantáneas, empaquetado con Cobra y plantillas embebidas.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed lang-en">
          Zero dependencies on the user's local system. Compiles down to a single binary for instant load speeds, packaged with Cobra and embedded template systems.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CARD 3: DAY 2 EVOLUTION (Spans 1 column) -->
    <div class="group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-surface/40 backdrop-blur-md p-6 sm:p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-brand-primary/5 hover:border-brand-primary/30">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-primary/5 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none"></div>

      <!-- Card Visual Mockup -->
      <div class="relative w-full flex-1 flex items-center justify-center min-h-[220px] mb-6">
        <div class="w-full bg-bg-base/90 rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle p-4 font-mono text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-text-muted group-hover:translate-y-[-4px] transition-transform duration-300 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-text-main font-bold border-b border-border-subtle pb-2 mb-3 select-none">
            <Layers size={14} class="text-brand-secondary" />
            <span class="lang-es">Evolución Activa de Stack</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Active Stack Evolution</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="space-y-2 select-none">
            <div class="p-1.5 bg-bg-surface rounded border border-border-subtle">
              <div class="text-brand-secondary font-bold">$ claw add auth</div>
              <div class="text-[9px] text-text-muted mt-0.5 lang-es">✔ Inyectó boilerplate de NextAuth</div>
              <div class="text-[9px] text-text-muted mt-0.5 lang-en">✔ Injected NextAuth boilerplate</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-1.5 bg-bg-surface rounded border border-border-subtle">
              <div class="text-brand-secondary font-bold">$ claw add database</div>
              <div class="text-[9px] text-text-muted mt-0.5 lang-es">✔ Añadió config de PostgreSQL</div>
              <div class="text-[9px] text-text-muted mt-0.5 lang-en">✔ Appended PostgreSQL config</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-1.5 bg-bg-surface rounded border border-border-subtle">
              <div class="text-brand-secondary font-bold">$ claw g component Card</div>
              <div class="text-[9px] text-text-muted mt-0.5 lang-es">✔ Creó src/components/Card.tsx</div>
              <div class="text-[9px] text-text-muted mt-0.5 lang-en">✔ Created src/components/Card.tsx</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card Copy -->
      <div class="mt-auto relative z-15 select-none">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary">
            <FolderTree size={18} />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-main lang-es">Generación de Código - Día 2</h3>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-main lang-en">Day 2 Code Generation</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed lang-es">
          El CLI permanece activo durante todo el ciclo de vida del proyecto. Evoluciona tu arquitectura e inyecta auth, bases de datos o componentes de manera modular.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed lang-en">
          The CLI is active throughout your project's lifecycle. Evolve your stack and inject database instances, auth schemes, and components modularly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CARD 4: BLUEPRINT SYNC (Spans 2 columns on MD+) -->
    <div class="md:col-span-2 group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-surface/40 backdrop-blur-md p-6 sm:p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-brand-secondary/5 hover:border-brand-secondary/30">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-secondary/5 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none"></div>

      <!-- Card Visual Mockup -->
      <div class="relative w-full flex-1 flex items-center justify-center min-h-[220px] mb-6 group-hover:translate-y-[-4px] transition-transform duration-300">
        <BentoRecipes client:load lang={lang} />
      </div>

      <!-- Card Copy -->
      <div class="mt-auto relative z-15 select-none">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-brand-secondary/10 text-brand-secondary">
            <Share2 size={18} />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-main lang-es">Setup Híbrido: Recetas y Pasos</h3>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-main lang-en">Hybrid Scaffolding: Recipes & Steps</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed lang-es">
          Inicializa al instante usando recetas listas para producción probadas, o compila plantillas personalizadas paso a paso respondiendo al cuestionario manual del CLI.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed lang-en">
          Boot instantly using ready-to-go, production-tested Recipes, or compile custom boilerplates step-by-step through manual configuration parameters.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Bento footer note -->
  <div class="text-center mt-12">
    <p class="text-xs text-text-muted font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors">
      <span class="lang-es">Y muchas más opciones pensadas para desarrolladores...</span>
      <span class="lang-en">And much more developer-centric options...</span>
      <ArrowRight size={12} />
    </p>
  </div>
</section>